title: The Reichstag Fraction
new-page: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and congress = 0 and c_reichstag_timer <= 0 and kpd_seats > 0
on-arrival: c_reichstag_timer = 4; month_actions += 1
frequency: 200
is-card: true
tags: germany

= The Reichstag Fraction

The party has [+ kpd_seats +] deputies in the Reichstag. [? if kpd_seats <= 4 : They are few, and the house laughs at them when they speak. ?][? if kpd_seats > 4 : They are a real fraction now, with an office, a whip and quarrels of their own. ?] Liebknecht used the house as a tribune to speak to the masses outside it.

- @tribune: Speak to the workers outside the house.
- @bills: Table bills with the social democrats.
- @obstruct: Obstruct the house until it throws us out.
- @easy_discard

@tribune
subtitle: The speeches are printed in every party paper.
on-arrival: worker_support += 4; lean_luxemburgist += 1

Our deputies speak about the hunger in Berlin, the murders in Bavaria and the profits of the Ruhr barons. The house empties. The speeches are read in the factories.

@bills
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] A tax on great fortunes. The social democrats will have to vote on it.
choose-if: lock_united_front < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids any deal with the social democrats.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_united_front == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
Q.spd_relation += 6;
Q.lean_unionist += 2;
!}

The bill fails, but some social democrats voted with us.

@obstruct
subtitle: The Left loves it. Our deputies will be barred from the house for months.
on-arrival: militancy += 6; offensive_satisfaction += 6; c_reichstag_timer = 9

Our deputies drown out the chancellor with whistles and are excluded for twenty sittings.
